Package: grace2pexa
Title: GRACE 2.0 One-Year Death and Death/MI - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Keith A. A.", "Fox", role = "ctb",
           comment = "First author of GRACE 2.0"))
Description: Implements the GRACE 2.0 one-year models for death and for death
    or myocardial infarction after an acute coronary syndrome (Fox et al., BMJ
    Open 2014 <doi:10.1136/bmjopen-2013-004425>), with their restricted cubic
    spline terms, from the GRACE Risk Score V2 coefficient sheets (Center for
    Outcomes Research, University of Massachusetts Medical School, 2012-2017)
    as reproduced in Hara et al., EuroIntervention 2022
    <doi:10.4244/EIJ-D-21-00536>, Supplementary Appendix 1. Other horizons and
    the older GRACE point scores are not included.
